Manifest (https://github.com/Bonasa-Tech/manifest)
Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.
- lib/ is Manifest's hypertree crate (red-black tree, free list, and node
  helpers), modified for yDelta in 2026.
- programs/ydelta/ is a modified version of the Manifest program, changed
  for yDelta in 2026. It builds on Manifest's market account layout (a fixed
  header followed by a hypertree region), claimed seats, resting orders,
  account validation, and instruction builders.

marginfi v2 (https://github.com/mrgn-labs/marginfi-v2)
Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
- programs/ydelta/tests/fixtures/marginfi.so and marginfi.idl.json are the
  marginfi v0.1.8 mainnet program binary and IDL, used as test fixtures.
